{
  "savint": {
    "version": 1,
    "title": "Sistema lineare 2x2",
    "description": "Risolvere un sistema di due equazioni lineari in due incognite con il metodo preferito.",
    "yearLevel": 2,
    "topic": "sistemi",
    "tags": ["sistemi-lineari", "due-incognite"],
    "difficulty": 2
  },
  "question": {
    "name": "Sistema lineare 2x2",
    "statement": "<p>Risolvi il sistema \\[\\begin{cases} \\simplify{ {a}x+{b}y } = \\var{c} \\\\ \\simplify{ {d}x+{e}y } = \\var{f} \\end{cases}\\]</p>",
    "advice": "<p>Con il metodo di sostituzione o di riduzione si trova \\(x = \\var{x0}\\) e \\(y = \\var{y0}\\). Puoi verificare il risultato sostituendo i valori trovati in entrambe le equazioni.</p>",
    "variables": {
      "a": { "name": "a", "definition": "random(2..6)" },
      "b": { "name": "b", "definition": "random(-6..6 except 0)" },
      "d": { "name": "d", "definition": "random(2..6 except a)" },
      "e": { "name": "e", "definition": "random(-6..6 except 0)" },
      "x0": { "name": "x0", "definition": "random(-5..5 except 0)" },
      "y0": { "name": "y0", "definition": "random(-5..5 except 0)" },
      "c": { "name": "c", "definition": "a*x0 + b*y0" },
      "f": { "name": "f", "definition": "d*x0 + e*y0" }
    },
    "variablesTest": { "condition": "a*e - b*d <> 0", "maxRuns": 200 },
    "parts": [
      {
        "type": "gapfill",
        "prompt": "<p>\\(x = \\) [[0]], \\(y = \\) [[1]]</p>",
        "gaps": [
          {
            "type": "numberentry",
            "marks": 1,
            "minValue": "x0",
            "maxValue": "x0",
            "allowFractions": false,
            "notationStyles": ["plain", "en", "si-en", "plain-eu", "eu", "si-fr"],
            "correctAnswerStyle": "plain-eu"
          },
          {
            "type": "numberentry",
            "marks": 1,
            "minValue": "y0",
            "maxValue": "y0",
            "allowFractions": false,
            "notationStyles": ["plain", "en", "si-en", "plain-eu", "eu", "si-fr"],
            "correctAnswerStyle": "plain-eu"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
